hatever  happened nationally this has been a  campaign that locally has been convert  conducted with all through all by all  candidates in a manner that I believe  was positive and was on the issues and  not on personalities and was a credit to  all parties that took it took part and I  thank you all for that  I am grateful to the people of the city  of Chester for this huge honor I  represent all the people of the city of  Chester I will do so to the very best of  my ability and I will bear this honor  that you have given me with pride with  dignity with grace and with  determination to get the very best for  this constituency in this city I thank  you all thank you
 

